tutorial_title = "HOW TO PLAY"
tutorial_text = "Notes roll from the drummers toward the big circle.

D = hit GREEN notes from the left
K = hit ORANGE notes from the right
(or click / touch the left and right halves of the screen)

Press when a note reaches the circle. Closer to the centre = better. Misses cost cash!

Esc or P pauses."
